This Privacy & Cookie Policy outlines how personal data and cookies are handled on this personal portfolio website.

### 1. General Overview

This website operates with a strong commitment to privacy and data minimization under the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). No personal identification data is sold, rented, or distributed to third parties.

### 2. Essential Local Storage (No Consent Required)

The site utilizes browser `localStorage` solely to remember visitor preferences between sessions. These items are stored locally in your browser and are never transmitted to external servers:

- **Theme Preference** (`portfolio-theme`): Stores your choice between Dark and Light mode.
- **Accessibility Preferences** (`portfolio-a11y`): Stores font size scaling, high contrast toggle, dyslexia-friendly spacing, and motion reduction settings.
- **Cookie Consent Choice** (`portfolio-cookie-consent`): Stores whether you have accepted or declined optional performance analytics.

### 3. Optional Analytics (Google Analytics 4)

With your explicit consent, this site uses optional Google Analytics (GA4) to measure website traffic and help improve content structure.

- **IP Anonymization**: IP addresses are automatically truncated and anonymized before processing.
- **Consent Mode v2**: Analytics scripts remain strictly disabled (`denied`) by default unless you click "Accept Analytics" on the cookie consent banner.
- **Cookie Control**: You can re-open your privacy preferences or revoke consent at any time via the Cookie Settings button in the floating Accessibility Widget.

### 4. Direct Communication

If you choose to contact me via email or phone, your contact information is used strictly to respond to your inquiry and is retained only as long as necessary for professional communication.

### 5. Your Rights Under GDPR

Under GDPR, you have the right to request access to any personal data provided, request rectification or erasure, or object to processing. To exercise any of these rights, please reach out directly via the email address listed in the contact section.
